\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\fi360\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A story about an AI company that is capable of turning a deceased person into an artificial one with the use of AI}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Agents will be sent to the house of the \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Client\u8221\'94 to provide documents, chat logs of social medias, share stories, and the House and Items that the deceased used to own}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The Agents then will feed the informations into a system that will turn it into an AI version of the deceased, they will talk the same, and act according to the information provided.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Plot twist: The base model of the AI is created from the Founder\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s deceased daughter.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Or maybe Plot Twist: is that the Protagonist\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s family that he had always mentions in the book are actually AI from the company. He was fed up because the fact that if his view is wrong about this company, then he is also wrong about his artificial family.}}